 experience, and technical expertise. The descriptions provide a good overview of his contributions, but they could be made more impactful by quantifying achievements and emphasizing the results he delivered.", 'ats_match': '75%', 'recommendations': ["Use action verbs to start each bullet point, highlighting your accomplishments. For example, instead of 'Developed and deployed RESTful APIs', try 'Developed and deployed highly scalable RESTful APIs for 7 banks, increasing product offerings by 20%.'", "Quantify the impact of your accomplishments wherever possible. For example, instead of 'Successfully deployed these solutions at over 7 banks', mention the specific impact on the banks' operations, such as 'increased transaction volume by 15%' or 'reduced processing time by 20%.'", 'Focus on achievements that are relevant to the job you are applying for. Tailor the descriptions to highlight skills and experiences that align with the specific requirements of the role.']}, {'title': 'Lead Ambassador I4G CUCG', 'description': "This section provides a good overview of Bamidele's involvement as a Lead Campus Ambassador for Ingressive for Good. He highlights his leadership skills, community building efforts, and experience organizing hackathons and coding events. The section showcases his passion for technology and his commitment to supporting the growth of developers in Africa.  However, the impact of his role could be further quantified.", 'ats_match': '70%', 'recommendations': ["Highlight the number of developers you mentored, the growth of the developer community, or the impact of the hackathons you organized. For example, 'Successfully mentored 50 developers, leading to a 20% increase in community engagement.'"]}, {'title': 'Education', 'description': "Bamidele's educational background is well-presented. The section clearly states his degree, institution, and dates of attendance. However, it could be strengthened by adding relevant coursework or project experiences that highlight his technical skills and abilities.", 'ats_match': '65%', 'recommendations': ["Include specific coursework related to programming languages, frameworks, or technologies used in the job description. For example, 'Completed coursework in Advanced Java Programming, Web Development with Spring Boot, and Machine Learning.'", 'Mention any relevant projects or research undertaken during your studies that showcase your skills and achievements.']}, {'title': 'Skills', 'description': "Bamidele's skills section effectively lists a range of programming languages, frameworks, and tools. This provides a good overview of his technical expertise.  However, it would benefit from a more tailored approach, focusing on skills that are directly relevant to the specific job requirements.", 'ats_match': '80%', 'recommendations': ['Prioritize skills that are most relevant to the job you are applying for. For example, if the job description emphasizes Java Spring Boot and Cloud technologies, highlight those skills first.', "Consider adding a brief description of your expertise in each skill area, demonstrating your depth of knowledge and experience. For example, 'Proficient in Java Spring Boot with experience building RESTful APIs and microservices.'"]}]}
