2024-09-05 16:27:17,744 - app - INFO - Analysis result: {'overall_feedback': 'Olusesgun,  your resume is like a Nigerian film: full of drama, a little bit chaotic, and maybe  just a tad over-the-top.  It\'s got ambition,  but it needs a good editor and maybe a little less *"action"*.  I see potential, but right now, it\'s giving  "I copied and pasted from a  website and added some fancy fonts".  Don\'t worry, though, I\'m here to help you rewrite your story and make it a box office hit.', 'feedback_cards': [{'title': 'Contact Information', 'description': 'So, Olusesgun, you\'re a big fan of "the more, the merrier" when it comes to contact information.  That\'s great,  but  maybe  choose one  primary contact and  make it  stand out.  The world doesn\'t need to know  you\'re  a fan of  "greater Accra Region".  And  "bishoptewogbade@gmail.com"?  Come on, man, get a professional email.  You\'re a software developer, not a priest!  (No offense to priests, of course.)'}, {'title': 'Summary', 'description': 'Olusesgun,  your summary is like  a  Nigerian  party:  full  of energy,  but a little  too  much.  I get it, you\'re  passionate, but  cut it  down,  my  man.  Show, don\'t tell.  No one  wants to read a  list of your skills; they want to see results.  And  "impactful solutions"?  That\'s  a little vague.  Give me something specific and  make me laugh.  (Or at least  impressed.)'}, {'title': 'Experience', 'description': 'Olusesgun, you\'ve got a lot of experience...  maybe  too much.  Your resume is a  marathon, not a  sprint.  Focus on your  top  3-4  experiences and  highlight your  biggest accomplishments.  We don\'t need to know  that you  installed a  notification  service for  "OmniBSIC  Ghana".  We  just want to  know that you\'re  good at your job,  and  that you can  deliver results.  Also,  "refactored and optimized solutions"?  That\'s  like  saying  you  "ate  and  slept".  Give me  specific numbers,  metrics,  and  examples!  Show me  you\'re a  rockstar, not just  another  developer.'}, {'title': 'Education', 'description': 'Olusesgun, you went to  "Catholic University College, Ghana."  That\'s  a  great  school,  but  don\'t  just  list  the  degree.  Tell me  what you learned.  Did  you  design  a  killer app in  your  class?  Did you  invent  a new  algorithm?  I want to see  your  school spirit! (Or at least  your  academic brilliance.)'}, {'title': 'Skills', 'description': "Olusesgun,  your  skills  list is  like a  buffet:  it's  got  everything,  but  it's  not  very  organized.  Group  your  skills  into  categories (programming languages,  frameworks,  tools).  And  don't  just list  the  skills you have.  Show me  how you  use them.  You're a  software developer,  so  make  your  resume look like  a  well-written  program."}, {'title': 'Lead Ambassador', 'description': "Olusesgun,  you're a  lead ambassador?  That's  impressive!  Don't just say  you  organized hackathons  and  coding events.  Tell me  about the  impact you made.  Did  you  inspire the  next  generation of  Nigerian developers?  Did  you  win  any  awards?  Let's  hear it!"}]}
