2024-09-06 06:27:13,343 - app - INFO - Session data after upload: <SecureCookieSession {'ai_response': {'introduction': "Alright, everybody, gather round! I've got a resume here that's got more typos than a toddler's first attempt at writing. This is like that friend who shows up to a party in a full suit, but their shirt's inside-out... and they're wearing flip-flops. It's trying so hard to impress, but it just... fails miserably. You ready for this? 'Cause this resume, it's about to get roasted so bad, it'll need a fire extinguisher. *Cue dramatic music* Let's begin...", 'steps': [{'description': "This resume is a textbook case of 'trying too hard.' It's got so many buzzwords, it sounds like a dictionary threw up on a keyboard.  And the formatting?  Don't even get me started. It's like a formatting tornado hit, then left a note saying, 'Sorry, I'm not good with spaces.'", 'header': 'First Impressions'}, {'description': "Let's break down this masterpiece, shall we? The summary? It's like a motivational poster made into a job description.  'Passionate' is the word of the year, I guess.  The experience section reads like a laundry list of companies and accomplishments.  This isn't a resume, it's a 'Look at all the cool things I've done' infomercial. The skills?  Oh, the skills.  It's got everything from 'Java' to 'Git' to 'Jenkins.'  It's like, 'Hey, I can code.  But I can also use a computer.'  It's a masterpiece of mediocrity.", 'header': 'Section-by-Section Roast'}, {'description': "You know what, I'm gonna 'keep it 100' with y'all.  This resume is like those friends who tell you they're 'successful' but they can't even spell 'entrepreneur' without Google.  You gon' learn today! *Kevin points dramatically at the resume*  This ain't about knowing a bunch of techy stuff.  It's about being able to communicate what you know.  And this, my friends, is a prime example of 'talkin' a big game, but not backin' it up.'", 'header': 'Kevin Hart-isms'}, {'description': "If I saw this resume in person, I'd be running around the room, arms flailing, screaming 'What is this?! What. Is. This?!' It's got so much content, but it feels so hollow. It's like those cardboard cutouts they put up at car dealerships, all dressed up, but no substance. You gotta bring the energy, baby!  This resume needs more 'oomph.'", 'header': 'Physical Comedy'}, {'description': "Look, I'm gonna give you some real talk.  You gotta cut the fluff, stop trying to impress everyone with all these buzzwords.  Focus on what makes you unique.  Show them what you can actually do.  Don't be afraid to be yourself, even if it means being 'slightly' less impressive. You might just surprise yourself. And who knows, you might actually land that dream job.  Just ditch the 'motivational poster' vibe and be authentic.  That's the real secret sauce to landing a gig.  Trust me, it'll save you a lot of time and headaches.", 'header': 'Real Talk'}]}, 'ai_roast_response': {'introduction': "Yo, welcome to the 'Roast Me' show! Today's subject? This resume! It's so desperate for attention, it's practically wearing a 'Look at me!' sign... made of pixels, of course. This thing's got more buzzwords than a tech conference in Silicon Valley. Let's break it down, shall we?  But first, lemme just say... this is some serious 'I'm trying too hard' energy. It's like the resume equivalent of those dudes who wear their gym clothes everywhere, even to the grocery store. You gon' learn today! ", 'steps': [{'description': "It's like a frantic student who just crammed for a test. I mean, the guy's got a LinkedIn URL, a Twitter handle, and even a website for his side hustle. This ain't your average resume, folks. This is a full-blown marketing campaign! But, you know what's missing? A good ol' fashioned resume objective. You know, the thing that actually tells the recruiter what you're looking for.  You gon' learn today! *Kevin rubs his chin thoughtfully and makes a 'hm' noise*", 'header': 'First Impressions'}, {'description': "Let's start with the 'Summary.' It's practically a love letter to every buzzword in the tech industry. Fintech, AI, mobile apps... it's like a word vomit session from a tech evangelist.  The 'Experience' section is a trip. This guy's a one-man tech army! He's done everything from building APIs to integrating AI chatbots.  He's even got a 'Lead Campus Ambassador' role for Ingressive for Good.  *Kevin does a dramatic hand gesture and snaps his fingers* You know what this tells me? This guy's got a serious case of 'FOMO' (Fear Of Missing Out). He's been to every conference, tried every tech stack, and done every side hustle.  But what about actually having a track record?  The 'Skills' section is a straight-up list of every programming language and framework under the sun. It's like the tech equivalent of a buffet.  *Kevin shakes his head and makes a 'tsk tsk' noise*  You know what they say... jack of all trades, master of none.  And finally, the 'Education' section.  'BSC Computer Science.'  *Kevin raises an eyebrow and smirks*  I mean, it's not a PhD in rocket science, but it'll do.  You gon' learn today!", 'header': 'Section-by-Section Roast'}, {'description': "This resume is so long, it's got a 'to be continued' at the bottom!  *Kevin looks around in disbelief and shakes his head*  This ain't a novel, dude! It's a resume! And this thing is more packed than a subway in rush hour.  *Kevin mimes riding a subway with exaggerated movements*  But the real kicker? This guy's got a 'Blue Vision Multimedia - BVM' gig...  *Kevin pauses and then whispers dramatically*  What is that even?  Blue Vision Multimedia?  I mean, the name alone makes me want to run for the hills!", 'header': 'Kevin Hart-isms'}, {'description': "If I saw this resume in person, I'd be running around the room, arms flailing, screaming 'What is this?! What. Is. This?!'  *Kevin dramatically throws his arms in the air and stomps his feet*  This thing's got more acronyms than a NASA mission!  *Kevin makes a confused face and mimes reading a document with his finger*  I'm just trying to find the information I need, man.  I'm not trying to decipher a secret code! You gon' learn today!", 'header': 'Physical Comedy'}, {'description': "Look, I get it. You want to impress the recruiter. You want to show them you're a tech guru with all the latest skills. But sometimes, less is more.  *Kevin leans in and whispers*  Focus on the key skills and projects that actually matter for the job. And ditch the 'I'm a tech rockstar' attitude.  *Kevin gives a thumbs up*  Let your work speak for itself.  You gon' learn today!", 'header': 'Real Talk'}]}, 'file_uri': 'gs://genaiq_cloudbuild/uploads/OlusegunTewogbadeResume.pdf', 'filename': 'OlusegunTewogbadeResume.pdf'}>
