2024-09-07 04:51:03,952 - app - INFO - Analysis result: {'introduction': "Alright, folks, gather 'round! We've got a resume here so long, it's got its own zip code.  This thing's been through more rewrites than a Kardashian marriage, but I'm not sure if it's getting any better. You know, it's like when you try to fix a broken chair by adding more broken chairs to it.  This resume? It's just adding more broken chairs!  Buckle up, because this roast is about to be as wild as a night out with Kevin Hart in Vegas! ", 'steps': [{'header': 'First Impressions', 'description': "This resume screams, 'I'm trying too hard, but I'm not really sure what I'm trying hard at!'"}, {'header': 'Section-by-Section Roast', 'description': "First off, 'OLUSEGUN TEW OGBADE'? That's a name longer than a Costco receipt. You gon' learn today, this resume is so overstuffed, I'm surprised it didn't burst into flames!  And the summary? It's like a high schooler writing their college essay while their parents hover over them, going, 'You gotta say you're passionate!'"}, {'header': 'Experience', 'description': "'Consultant Programmer' -  sounds more like a title for a PowerPoint presentation than an actual job.  Listen, I love a good tech resume, but this one's so full of buzzwords, I swear I saw a swarm of bees leaving the room. 'RESTful APIs'  -  that's the only rest you're getting with this resume.  It's so packed, it looks like you're trying to cram every single technology ever invented into one document!"}, {'header': 'Skills', 'description': "Ah yes, the skills section.  I'm guessing this person learned JavaScript from a YouTube tutorial, because  'JavaScript' is about as descriptive as saying 'I know how to use a computer.'  And look,  'Git'?  That's like saying you know how to use Google Maps - it's the bare minimum! This skills list is so underwhelming, it's making me question my entire career choices.  You gon' learn today! "}, {'header': 'Kevin Hart-isms', 'description': "This resume is so long, it's like watching a Kevin Hart movie with all the deleted scenes! *Shrugs* *Throws hands up in the air*"}, {'header': 'Physical Comedy', 'description': "If I saw this resume in person, I'd be like, 'You know, I'm pretty sure I saw this resume at a garage sale the other day, they were selling it for a dollar!'"}, {'header': 'Real Talk', 'description': "Okay, real talk time. This resume is a hot mess. It's got more buzzwords than a  'tech conference' at a high school.  But hey, you know what? You're ambitious! You're trying! Now, take a deep breath, grab a cup of coffee, and let's rework this thing.  Because, honey, you're better than this.  Trust me, this resume needs a serious makeover, maybe a little bit of a glow-up.  But hey, with a little work, you can transform this hot mess into a resume that's so good, it'll make even Kevin Hart smile! "}]}
