2024-09-07 04:56:19,418 - app - INFO - Analysis result: {'introduction': "Alright, everybody! Let's give it up for the man, the myth, the... well, let's just say this resume needs a serious 'How To Write a Resume for Dummies' crash course.  This thing is so generic it could be a template straight outta 2005, back when dial-up was the hottest tech!  Let's dive in, cuz you gon' learn today!", 'steps': [{'header': 'First Impressions', 'description': "First, I gotta ask, where's the personality?  This thing is drier than a popcorn fart in the Sahara.  Is this a resume or a Wikipedia entry about the history of software development?  It's like they took a buzzword bingo card, threw it at a wall, and called it a career summary.  I'm not even sure what this guy does, besides being a walking, talking encyclopedia of tech terms."}, {'header': 'Section-by-Section Roast', 'description': "**Experience**:  Consultant Programmer?  Sounds like the kind of job you get when you tell everyone you're a 'software developer' but don't actually know how to write code.  And 'leading a team'?  Maybe he leads a team of hamsters on a wheel, because I ain't seeing any real leadership here.  'Developed AI-driven solutions'?  Oh yeah?  So did I when I put together that killer playlist for my last road trip.  **Education**:  Catholic University College, Ghana?  Hey, more power to 'em, but did they teach 'em how to write a resume?  'Cause I don't think they did.  **Skills**:  Java, Python, Dart, SQL...  Okay, I'll give him this one:  he's got the basics down.  But I'm waiting for the 'expert-level' skills, like 'Can code a chatbot that makes jokes better than Kevin Hart'—which, by the way, is a tall order."}, {'header': 'Kevin Hart-isms', 'description': "'You gon' learn today!' about how to write a resume that doesn't sound like it was written by a robot.  And what's with all the bolding?  You trying to make up for your lack of accomplishments?  'Cause I gotta tell you, the boldface ain't doing it for me.  It's like, 'Yo, look at this resume!  It's so fancy!''"}, {'header': 'Physical Comedy', 'description': "If I saw this resume in person, I'd be doing that little side-eye thing, like, 'Uh-huh, I see you.  You think you're all that?'  Then I'd pull out my phone and start scrolling through my LinkedIn, just to show him what a real resume looks like.  I'd be like, 'Yo, you think this is impressive?  Hold my beer.  Let me show you how it's done.'"}, {'header': 'Real Talk', 'description': "Look, I get it.  We all gotta start somewhere.  But this resume is like a first draft that never got edited.  It's got potential, but it needs a whole lot of work.  Take some time, find your voice, and show the world what you're truly capable of.  And hey, if you need help with the writing, hit me up.  I'm sure I can give you some pointers.  You gon' learn today!  But for real, this resume needs a reboot.  Make it pop, make it personal, make it hilarious.  And then, you can start making the world laugh."}]}
